# English Development App — Cursor Rules

## General
- Always use TypeScript.
- Write clean, modular, and well-commented code.

## Backend (FastAPI)
- Use async/await for all I/O-bound operations.
- Use SQLAlchemy ORM for database access.
- Use Pydantic models for request/response validation.
- Follow REST API best practices (proper HTTP methods, status codes, and resource naming).

## Mobile App (React Native)
- Use Expo and Expo Router.
- Prefer functional components.
- Use Axios for all API calls.

## Admin Panel (Next.js)
- Use the App Router.
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling.
- Use shadcn/ui for all UI components.

## Environment & Secrets
- Always use `.env` files for secrets (e.g. OpenAI API keys, Database URLs).
- Never hardcode secrets in source code.
- Remind the developer to keep `.env` out of version control and to provide `.env.example` where helpful.
